> use, then.  Is the regeneration Hungerless, or not?
>

Its not regeneration.  The bonus for your healthstones is added to your
current constitution when calculating hp recovery- the way that works if
your effective level [exp level+ health bonus] is greater than 9, 
every 3 turns, you get a random number between 1 and your effective
constitution [cons + healthbonus], capped at (effective level -9)
hp healed.  if you are regenerating, you get 1 hp back on other turns.



